  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: I should have burned this bouquet when they came to lay it on her grave.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "But isn\u2019t that desecration, my father ?!"
  - speaker: 1
    text: One can only profane the tombs of devout believers. If the person buried
      have already become a lost soul, it is just a clean up.
  - speaker: 1
    text: If only she wasn't keeping watch over her grave, I could finally get rid
      of this memory.
